<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθερεών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chin,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιτερῇ δ᾽ ἄρ᾽ ὑπ᾽ ἀνθερεῶνος
				ἑλοῦσα,</span> in token of supplication, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.501
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ νείατον ἀνθερεῶνα,</span>
			i.e. just under the <i>chin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				5.293
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				444
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
				<i>neck, throat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				92.1
			</span></i> (pl.): sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.129
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nestor</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.110
			</span></i>: sg. in both senses, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				47
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mouth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.247
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25.476
			</span></i>.</div>
